  "body": "The spec for the `spellcheck` attribute does not explicitly define whether the attribute should [inherit](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-spellcheck-default-inherit) across shadow boundaries. Unfortunately, browsers also don't seem to be interoperable in this aspect - Chromium/WebKit do allow the `spellcheck` attribute to inherit across shadow boundaries while Mozilla does not.\r\n\r\nFiling this issue to explore whether interoperability can be achieved and whether a spec update can be made to clarify this behavior.\r\n\r\ncc: @mfreed7 @domenic @marcoscaceres @smaug---- ",
